Flutter engine
--------------
Everything under `src/` except `src/flutter/rust/` comes from
https://github.com/flutter/flutter, at commit cf97bfbcb9f. Of 4,559 files, 64
are modified and the rest are byte-for-byte upstream. Copyright 2014 The Flutter
Authors, BSD-3-Clause; see LICENSE.

That subset includes upstream's own vendored test fonts under
`src/flutter/txt/third_party/fonts/` (Roboto, Noto, Ahem, Homemade Apple) and
various test fixtures. They are redistributed exactly as upstream ships them,
and upstream records their individual licenses in
`engine/src/flutter/ci/licenses_golden/` in the flutter/flutter repository.

`src/flutter/rust/` is this project's own work. Its files carry the same Flutter
copyright header as the tree they were written into, and the same BSD-3-Clause
terms.


Gallery assets
--------------
`src/flutter/rust/examples/flutter_gallery/assets/` holds artwork copied from
upstream so the port shows the same pictures rather than stand-ins. None of it
was authored here.

  studies/*_card*.png                 flutter_gallery_assets 1.0.2
  icons/{material,cupertino,reference}.png
                                      flutter_gallery_assets 1.0.2
  fonts/GalleryIcons.ttf              flutter_gallery_assets 1.0.2
      Copyright 2014 The Flutter Authors. BSD-3-Clause, see LICENSE.

  fonts/MaterialIcons-Regular.otf     Flutter SDK,
                                      bin/cache/artifacts/material_fonts/
      Apache License 2.0, see LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

  shrine/*.jpg  (38 product photographs)
                                      shrine_images 2.0.2, from pub.dev
      Copyright the Material Components for Flutter Codelabs authors.
      Apache License 2.0, see LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

The assets are compiled into the binary with `include_bytes!` rather than loaded
from disk, so a distributed executable carries them and this notice applies to
it as well.


Dependencies fetched at sync time
---------------------------------
`DEPS` names third-party libraries -- Skia, ICU, harfbuzz, ANGLE, libpng,
freetype and others -- that `gclient sync` downloads into `src/flutter/
third_party/`. None of them are in this repository, and each carries its own
license in its own checkout.
